&lt;p&gt;Block is one company built from many blocks, all united by the same purpose: economic empowerment. We build technology that increases access and independence for sellers, individuals, and artists around the world. Working at Block means working on and across our brands—Square, Cash App, Afterpay, TIDAL, Spiral, and Proto— in roles that connect, enable, and push all of them forward faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re remote-first by design and operate with intelligence at the center of everything we do. At Block, you&#39;ll be challenged by some of the brightest, most creative minds in the industry and have the tools and autonomy to do the most meaningful work of your career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Global Fulfillment Operations Specialist at Block, you’ll drive reliable day-to-day fulfillment of hardware across our global brands and markets. You’ll work through third-party logistics providers (3PLs) and alongside regional supplier managers to keep orders moving, resolve operational exceptions, improve inventory and shipment visibility, and strengthen the processes that connect our systems and fulfillment partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This individual contributor role combines hands-on operational execution, analytical problem-solving, and continuous improvement. You’ll independently own fulfillment outcomes, turning recurring issues into durable controls and scalable processes rather than repeated manual work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Fulfillment Execution &amp;amp; Partner Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own fulfillment outcomes from order release through shipment confirmation for customer orders, replacements, inventory transfers, and other fulfillment flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor order accuracy, processing timeliness, backlog, holds, and shipment exceptions; coordinate recovery and prioritize work within established business guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive outcomes through 3PL partners, ensuring they own their commitments rather than transferring recurring work to Block.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional supplier managers on service expectations, performance reviews, capacity risks, and operational improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear escalation paths and cross-time-zone handoffs; support continuity and recovery during disruptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage actionable reporting on fulfillment performance, exceptions, and corrective actions; use data to prioritize and measure improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems, Inventory &amp;amp; Operational Controls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate order, inventory, and shipment discrepancies across systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate inventory reconciliation and resolution of interface failures, missing transactions, configuration errors, and data issues with the appropriate owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate system and process changes before and after implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain warehouse procedures and controls that ensure accurate execution, traceability, and reliable handoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Launch Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring failures and manual work; eliminate, automate, or simplify them through root-cause improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently lead defined improvement initiatives through implementation and measured results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build standard work, self-service resources, and exception-management processes that reduce individual intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable product launches, new markets and channels, and warehouse or system transitions by testing fulfillment flows and closing readiness gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Cost Management &amp;amp; Billing Controls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate fulfillment supplier invoices against contracted rates, actual activity, and approved charges; resolve discrepancies and track credits through closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor spend and cost per order, investigate variances, and identify savings opportunities without compromising service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with supplier managers and Finance to improve billing accuracy, cost reporting, and automated controls that prevent recurring errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience &amp;amp; Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant experience in fulfillment, order management, warehouse operations, logistics, or supply chain, or an equivalent combination of education and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge of ERP, order-management, and warehouse-management systems, including investigating transaction and inventory discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and proficiency with driving controls through operational reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to independently manage operational workflows, resolve exceptions, and deliver defined improvement projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify root causes and build repeatable solutions rather than rely on recurring manual intervention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence internal stakeholders and external partners without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Oracle or comparable ERP platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting global hardware fulfillment across direct-to-consumer, retail, or business-to-business channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with integrations between ERP, order-management, and 3PL warehouse systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building dashboards, automated reporting, or workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting product launches, warehouse transitions, or fulfillment-system changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of international logistics and the handoffs between fulfillment, freight, and trade compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re working to build a more inclusive economy where our customers have equal access to opportunity, and we strive to live by these same values in building our workplace. Block is a proud equal opportunity employer. We work hard to evaluate all employees and job applicants consistently, based solely on the core competencies required of the role at hand, and without regard to any legally protected class.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe in being fair, and are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including providing reasonable accommodations to disabled applicants throughout the recruitment process. We encourage applicants to share any needed accommodations with their recruiter, who will treat these requests as confidentially as possible. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about what we’re doing to build an inclusive workplace? Check out our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/news/inclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inclusion &amp;amp; Diversity page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
